(Suraraj Pradhan requires the Property as his only or principal home. He currently lives at 26A Rhodes Place, Oldbrook, Milton Keynes, MK6 2LX. His son turns four in December 2026 and he intends to move to the Property to support the school application; the proposed school is about 200 metres away and the Property is in its catchment area. He intends to occupy the Property permanently as his sole and main home. The current tenancy began on 25 November 2025. The earliest date for proceedings in this notice is 20 December 2026, after the initial 12-month period. The claimant relies on title evidence, current-address evidence and his signed witness statement. He does not rely on Ground 8 or on any assertion that GOA granted the tenancy without consent. No previous notice is relied upon.) Tj
